{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_1_level_main_01-12_end","groupId":"main_1","stageId":"main_01-12","title":"代価","storyCode":"1-12","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-12_end.txt","sourceHash":"a472e14b795ca2033ee7caa767f5e0a6600e357ead3ac36e61fedd3cce3b675c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"しばし交戦したのち、Wは突然、ロドス一行を見逃すと言い出した。\n疑問と悲しみ、そして深い疲労を抱えたまま、一行はようやく我が家へと戻っていくのだった。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十二关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"この感覚……なんだか、すっごく懐かしいわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あんた……アーミヤっていったわよね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"アハハッ、なるほど。……そういうことだったのね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あんたのこと、覚えておくわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……何を、言って……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"あたしの欲しいものは手に入った、ってことよ。……ほら、行くならさっさと行きなさい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ、あなたは――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"おい、W……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"――まさかここで死のうってわけじゃないんでしょう？　あたしは別に、それでもいいけどね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"……ったく……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"……お前ら、繁華街まで撤退だ。あの連中は放っておけ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"えっ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"こっちは飽き飽きしてんのよ。このままグダグダ続けてたってつまんないもの。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"――さて。次会う時を楽しみにしてるわ、アーミヤ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、もちろん――そっちのあんたも、ね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"っ……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"今度は事の真相を聞かせてもらうわよ、{@Nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃ、またね～。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……彼女は、どうしてこんなことを……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"理由はわからんが……連中が退いたのは確かだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"……なんにせよ、作戦の想定時刻を大幅に超えてしまった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我々のほうも、今すぐ引き上げるとしよう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……はい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私……後方のオペレーターたちの、援護に回りますね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……アーミヤ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"心配しないでください。私は、大丈夫ですから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ニアール","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"……わかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ドーベルマン","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"では、頼んだ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……う、っ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"…………あ、れ……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"た……隊長……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……ほかの……人たちは……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"ニアールとドーベルマンのチームなら、無事に包囲を突破した。無論アーミヤとDr.{@nickname}を連れて、な。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"だが、あの女を足止めするために残ってくれた連中は……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"……皆、死んでいった。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……そ、んな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"俺とお前が、最後の生き残りってわけだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……そう、だ……そうだった……あの、タルラとかいう……化け物が……たった、一人で……っ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"前衛の、仲間が……全員、吹き飛ばされ、て……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"重装……オペレーター、ですら……あんな、簡単に……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"……無理に話すな。お前の傷だって浅くないんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"ですが……！　あれは、天災……そのもの、です……！　一瞬で、何もかもを……灰に、変えて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"まだ……信じられ、ません……あんな、アーツが……本当に、あるなんて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……俺は……叫ぶ、ばっかりで……ぐ、ぅ……ごほっ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"わかったから、もうよせ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……すみません……俺……何も、できませんでした……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"……いい。とにかく、落ち着くんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"お前の傷には、応急処置をしておいた。これで当分はもつだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"――待って、ください……隊長……その腕……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、これか？　大したことないさ。もう片方はまだ動くしな。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"っ……！！　……俺のことは、いいですから……逃げて、ください……あなただけなら、逃げ切れる……はずです……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"そうはいかん。俺たちはまだ、あの化け物相手に数分稼いだだけだからな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"ドクターとアーミヤが無事に撤退し終えるまで、逃げるわけにはいかないのさ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"……さて、俺は奴を足止めしに行ってくる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"だったら、俺も……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"おいおい、やめてくれ。俺は、腕一本と引き替えにお前の命を拾ったんだぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"たとえそれが、お前の寿命を一分延ばしただけだったとしても――その一分には、俺の腕をかける価値があったと思わせてくれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……隊長……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"自分を大事にしろよ。……すぐに戻る。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_7"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"……本当に……情けないな、俺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"――アーミヤ、さん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前衛オペレーター","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"皆の、願いを……託します……あなたなら、きっと……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……皆が、逃がしてくれて……なのに、私……う、ぅ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……アーミヤ、さん……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"…………アーミヤさん……？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ……すみません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"……どうか、したんですか……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……い、いえ。でも、なんだか急に……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"心が、ずきりと痛んで……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"それって……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"……ま、まさか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"ぅ、ううっ……そ、んな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……どうか、泣かないでください。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"今はまだ……我慢、しましょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"以前、ある人がこう教えてくれたんです……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"涙は……戦いが終わる時まで取っておけ、って……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"だから、今は……泣いてはいけないと、思います。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医療オペレーター","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"はい……ぅ……わかり、ました……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……一緒に、帰りましょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"私たちの家――ロドスへ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ep01"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["前衛オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医療オペレーター"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["レユニオン構成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["ドーベルマン"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["ニアール"]},{"speakerId":"char_1504_cqbw","aliases":["W"]}]}
